(text "console-rp: the console with no radio. See hardware/console-rp/README.md.\nEvery connection is a name: a net label or a power symbol at the end of each pin's stub." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "141e9d30-fae7-4360-82d1-2a876989f0dc"))
(text "The link. The USB-C's D+ and D- reach the CH343P and nothing else.\nTXD/RXD go to UART1 (GPIO21/20). DTR and RTS are NOT connected,\non purpose: the computer can't reset the RP2350 or hold BOOTSEL.\nDon't add auto-reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 5.08 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e0f56e21-ef06-40a4-816b-567d4af56e93"))
(text "The RP2350's regulator (L1, C1, C2, R1, C3) is Raspberry Pi's minimal design.\nCopy its layout and L1's orientation exactly (Hardware design with RP2350, 2.1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 157.48 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ce1faa1e-3f8a-4a28-a2a0-7e4b94b23d54"))
(text "J2: pin order from the seller's listing. Check it on the panel before the layout." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 264.16 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2c11c493-c5ca-499d-b58e-d0aad3529e96"))
(text "J3 is not fitted: holes for a header at the bench.\nSWD, and the RP2350's own USB: its REPL, and USB boot\n(hold BOOTSEL, press RESET). Nothing reaches them through the USB-C.\nTP1-TP7 are the same lines and RUN, as pads on the back for a jig." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 355.6 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "313adabe-69a9-4d6e-ba3e-ea6a61908599"))
